{"seq":1,"slug":"flexbox","title":"Flexbox 弹性布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/layout/flexbox","wordCount":1290,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"flexbox-弹性布局\">Flexbox 弹性布局</h1><p>导航栏里的 logo 靠左、菜单靠右、中间自动撑开；一行卡片不论几个都均匀分布且垂直居中——这类&quot;沿一条线分配空间&quot;的需求，正是 Flexbox 的主场。它把过去要靠浮动加 <code>clearfix</code>、靠 <code>inline-block</code> 加间隙修补才能勉强做到的事，变成了几条声明就能精确求解的弹性布局。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Flexbox 是一维布局：所有 flex 子项沿一条主轴（main axis）排列，垂直于主轴的方向是交叉轴（cross axis）。容器（<code>display: flex</code>）设定方向与对齐策略，子项则用 <code>flex-grow</code>、<code>flex-shrink</code>、<code>flex-basis</code> 描述自己在剩余空间里如何伸缩。理解&quot;主轴决定排列、交叉轴决定对齐&quot;这一对概念，Flexbox 的所有属性都能归位。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[display: flex 容器] --&gt; B[主轴方向&lt;br/&gt;flex-direction: row / column]&#10;  A --&gt; C[主轴对齐&lt;br/&gt;justify-content]&#10;  A --&gt; D[交叉轴对齐&lt;br/&gt;align-items / align-content]&#10;  A --&gt; E[换行&lt;br/&gt;flex-wrap]&#10;  A --&gt; F[子项弹性&lt;br/&gt;flex: grow shrink basis]&#10;  F --&gt; F1[grow 瓜分剩余空间]&#10;  F --&gt; F2[shrink 空间不足时收缩]&#10;  F --&gt; F3[basis 伸缩前的初始尺寸]\">flowchart TD\n  A[display: flex 容器] --&gt; B[主轴方向&lt;br/&gt;flex-direction: row / column]\n  A --&gt; C[主轴对齐&lt;br/&gt;justify-content]\n  A --&gt; D[交叉轴对齐&lt;br/&gt;align-items / align-content]\n  A --&gt; E[换行&lt;br/&gt;flex-wrap]\n  A --&gt; F[子项弹性&lt;br/&gt;flex: grow shrink basis]\n  F --&gt; F1[grow 瓜分剩余空间]\n  F --&gt; F2[shrink 空间不足时收缩]\n  F --&gt; F3[basis 伸缩前的初始尺寸]</pre><p>下表区分容器属性与子项属性，这是初学者最常搞混的边界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>控制什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>flex-direction</code></td>\n<td>容器</td>\n<td>主轴方向（row/column 及反向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>justify-content</code></td>\n<td>容器</td>\n<td>子项沿主轴的分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>align-items</code></td>\n<td>容器</td>\n<td>子项沿交叉轴的对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flex-wrap</code></td>\n<td>容器</td>\n<td>单行还是允许换行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flex</code> (grow/shrink/basis)</td>\n<td>子项</td>\n<td>单个子项如何伸缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>align-self</code></td>\n<td>子项</td>\n<td>覆盖容器的 <code>align-items</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>order</code></td>\n<td>子项</td>\n<td>视觉顺序（不改 DOM 顺序）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主轴与交叉轴-方向决定一切\">主轴与交叉轴：方向决定一切</h2><p><code>flex-direction</code> 一改，<code>justify-content</code> 和 <code>align-items</code> 控制的方向就互换。默认 <code>row</code> 时主轴水平，<code>justify-content</code> 管水平分布、<code>align-items</code> 管垂直对齐；切到 <code>column</code> 后主轴变垂直，两者职责对调。这是 Flexbox 最需要内化的一点：对齐属性绑定的是&quot;轴&quot;而非固定的&quot;水平/垂直&quot;。</p>\n<p>正因如此，&quot;水平垂直居中&quot;在 Flexbox 里只需两行，且与方向无关地稳健：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".center {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;  justify-content: center;&#10;  align-items: center;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  justify-content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  align-items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>flex-direction</code> 还有 <code>row-reverse</code>/<code>column-reverse</code> 反向变体——它们只反转视觉排列顺序，不改变 DOM 结构，因此会带来键盘焦点顺序与视觉顺序不一致的无障碍风险，应谨慎使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flex-简写-grow-shrink-basis-的求解\">flex 简写：grow、shrink、basis 的求解</h2><p><code>flex</code> 是三个属性的简写：<code>flex-grow</code>（剩余空间的瓜分比例）、<code>flex-shrink</code>（空间不足时的收缩比例）、<code>flex-basis</code>（伸缩前的基准尺寸）。浏览器先按 <code>flex-basis</code> 给每个子项分配初始尺寸，算出主轴上的剩余空间（可正可负），再按比例分配。</p>\n<p>当剩余空间为正，按 <code>flex-grow</code> 比例瓜分：若三个子项 grow 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1, 1, 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，剩余空间记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，则它们各得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{4}S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{4}S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2}{4}S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。当剩余空间为负（子项总基准超过容器），按 <code>flex-shrink</code> 加权收缩。记住几个常用简写的含义能省去大量记忆：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>简写</th>\n<th>等价于</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>flex: 1</code></td>\n<td><code>1 1 0%</code></td>\n<td>等分剩余空间，basis 归零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flex: auto</code></td>\n<td><code>1 1 auto</code></td>\n<td>按内容大小为基准再伸缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flex: none</code></td>\n<td><code>0 0 auto</code></td>\n<td>完全不伸缩，固定为内容尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flex: 0 1 200px</code></td>\n<td>原样</td>\n<td>不放大、可收缩、基准 200px</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个高频坑：<code>flex: 1</code> 把 basis 设为 <code>0%</code>，所以多个 <code>flex: 1</code> 的子项最终等宽，与各自内容多少无关；而 <code>flex: auto</code> 的 basis 是 <code>auto</code>，会先尊重内容宽度再分配剩余，结果不等宽。选哪个取决于你要的是&quot;严格等分&quot;还是&quot;内容优先&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对齐-换行与间距\">对齐、换行与间距</h2><p>交叉轴对齐有 <code>align-items</code>（管单行内所有子项）和 <code>align-content</code>（管多行之间的整体分布，仅在换行后生效）两层，初学者常误用。当只有一行时设 <code>align-content</code> 不起作用，要改的是 <code>align-items</code>。</p>\n<p><code>flex-wrap: wrap</code> 允许子项在空间不足时换行，配合 <code>flex-basis</code> 能做出&quot;每项至少多宽、放不下就换行&quot;的响应式行。子项之间的间距推荐用 <code>gap</code>——它只在子项之间产生间隙、不在容器边缘留白，比给每个子项加 <code>margin</code> 再处理首尾元素干净得多。<code>gap</code> 在 Flexbox 里 Baseline 可用，与<a href=\"grid\">Grid 网格布局</a>里的 <code>gap</code> 是同一套机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".tag-row {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;  flex-wrap: wrap;&#10;  gap: 0.5rem;&#10;}&#10;.tag-row &gt; * {&#10;  flex: 0 1 auto;&#10;} /* 按内容大小、放不下就换行 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.tag-row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex-wrap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">wrap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.tag-row</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 按内容大小、放不下就换行 */</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"flexbox-与-grid-的分工\">Flexbox 与 Grid 的分工</h2><p>Flexbox 与 Grid 不是竞争关系，而是覆盖不同维度。Flexbox 是一维的、内容驱动的：你不预先定义网格，子项按自身内容和伸缩规则排队，适合数量不定、大小由内容决定的元素，如标签云、按钮组、导航项。Grid 是二维的、布局驱动的：你先画好行列网格，再把元素放进去，适合需要行列同时对齐的整页结构。</p>\n<p>真实页面常常二者嵌套：用 <a href=\"grid\">Grid</a> 搭整页骨架，每个区块内部用 Flexbox 排内容。判断标准很简单——只关心一个方向上的排列与伸缩，用 Flexbox；需要行与列同时对齐，用 Grid。两者的间距都靠 <code>gap</code>，对齐属性命名也高度一致（<code>justify-*</code>/<code>align-*</code>），学会一个能迁移到另一个。Flex 容器创建的格式化上下文里外边距不再合并，这一点的原理见<a href=\"../foundations/box-model-formatting\">盒模型与格式化上下文</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Flexbox 是一维布局，核心是主轴与交叉轴；对齐属性绑定的是轴而非固定的水平/垂直，<code>flex-direction</code> 一改职责互换。</li>\n<li>容器属性（<code>justify-content</code>/<code>align-items</code>/<code>flex-wrap</code>）与子项属性（<code>flex</code>/<code>align-self</code>/<code>order</code>）职责分明，勿混用。</li>\n<li><code>flex: 1</code>（basis 0）严格等分，<code>flex: auto</code>（basis auto）内容优先；剩余空间按 grow 比例分、不足按 shrink 收缩。</li>\n<li>间距用 <code>gap</code> 而非 margin，更干净且不在边缘留白；多行整体分布用 <code>align-content</code>，单行内对齐用 <code>align-items</code>。</li>\n<li>一维内容驱动用 Flexbox，二维布局驱动用 Grid，真实页面常二者嵌套。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Flexbox 弹性布局","id":"flexbox-弹性布局"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主轴与交叉轴：方向决定一切","id":"主轴与交叉轴-方向决定一切"},{"level":2,"text":"flex 简写：grow、shrink、basis 的求解","id":"flex-简写-grow-shrink-basis-的求解"},{"level":2,"text":"对齐、换行与间距","id":"对齐-换行与间距"},{"level":2,"text":"Flexbox 与 Grid 的分工","id":"flexbox-与-grid-的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"值、单位与函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/foundations/values-units-functions"},"next":{"title":"Grid 网格布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/layout/grid"}}